+/*
+ * dct16.  The C reuses t9a/t10a/t13a/t14a across stages; here each stage gets
+ * its own name (suffix _b, _c) so the dataflow is explicit.
+ *
+ * Every "+ inN" / "- inN" correction in the C is folded back into the
+ * multiplier, which is exact since 4096 = 2^12.  The one non-obvious case:
+ *     ((-(t13*(3784-4096) + t10*1567) + 2048) >> 12) - t13
+ *       == (t13*-3784 + t10*-1567 + 2048) >> 12
