+ *
+ * Correction folding, both directions (4096 = 2^12 exactly):
+ *     v * (C - 4096)  with a paired  + v   ->  v *  C
+ *     v * (4096 - C)  with a paired  - v   ->  v * -C
+ * i.e. drop the +/-4096 from the multiplier and drop the correction.
+ *
+ * The even half comes from dct32 in its tx64 form, which is why only the odd
+ * inputs 1,3,..,31 are read: AV1 zeroes coefficients 32..63 of a 64-point
+ * transform, and the whole tx64 path exists to exploit that.
