+     * The loads stay in C -- plain loads bundle fine, it is only asm() that the
+     * bundler cannot place.  Everything after them is one asm block: written as
+     * helpers this kernel issued sixteen separate pmpy2 asm()s, each one alone
+     * in a bundle behind a stop, so it spent more cycles on stop bits than on
+     * arithmetic.  pmpy2/pack4/mux2/pshr4 are I-type and take the I slots;
+     * padd4 is A-type and fills the M slots beside them.
